# Synthetic dependency-parsed witnesses for the CoNLL-U-bound catalogs.
# Hand-annotated in UD Japanese GSD style, committed so the counted-work
# screen has sentences the relation filter actually runs over. The first
# four exercise every patterns/ud-dependency.lx pattern, including both
# argument orders; the fifth is patterns/double-wo-dep.lx's, and carries a
# competing capture assignment.
# sent_id = witness-sov
# text = 猫が魚を食べる。
